dm Cast Mono
============

docs/assets/font/dm-cast-mono.woff2 is a subset, built by scripts/casts/font.sh
from Nerd Fonts 3.3.0's patched JetBrains Mono:

  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/raw/v3.3.0/patched-fonts/JetBrainsMono/Ligatures/Regular/JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Regular.ttf

It holds printable ASCII, every codepoint dm's Go sources draw, and every
codepoint the recorded casts carry. The advance is 600 units for text and for
the patched icons, so the terminal grid stays aligned.

The subset is a modified font, so it carries its own name and not the upstream
one. The copyright, the trademark and the SIL Open Font License records are
untouched, and OFL.txt beside this file is the licence the OFL requires the
subset to travel with. JetBrains Mono is by the JetBrains Mono Project Authors;
the Nerd Fonts patching is by Ryan L McIntyre and contributors.

Run `make docs-font` after a cast grows a codepoint the font lacks.
